<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 4,300 MT were primarily the result of increases for China (18,500 MT, including 18,000 MT switched from unknown destinations), Turkey (6,100 MT, including 6,000 MT switched from unknown destinations), and Singapore (1,000 MT) being partially offset by reductions for unknown destinations (24,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 25,600 MT were to China (18,500 MT), Turkey (6,100 MT), Canada (600 MT) and Mexico (400 MT).</p>
</text>
